{"cluster_id": "C-1742", "topic": "When Probe A fired, the round aborted folding, held the cursor, and a la", "target": "architecture/garbage-collection", "member_ids": ["B026-056"], "canonical_claim": "When Probe A fired, the round aborted folding, held the cursor, and a later complete enumeration folded the missing records; the three keys were deleted six minutes later and no leak resulted.", "issue_ids": [], "sources": ["docs/superpowers/reports/2026-07-26-list-incompleteness-investigation.md#failclosed"]}
